<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρι-έλικτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλίσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thrice coiled,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφις</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.77
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μαιάνδρου τ. ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.110
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				Mnasalc.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἰχνοπέδαν</span> a noose
				<i>of three threads,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				109
			</span></i> (Antip.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. νῆμα</span> (of the
			Fates) ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.14
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. θώρακες,</span>
			of three 'crow's-nests' (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωράκια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Moschio
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.208e
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>App.Anth.</u>
				3.82.9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Archimelus</span>).</div>
